/span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">为主题，盈科沈阳合伙人、博望团队合伙人</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">党俏律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">与博望团队业务合伙人</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">刘舒律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">为在场近60位餐饮人带来了一场干货满满的课程分享。主持人为博望团队</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">冯诗涵律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本次课堂聚焦经营过程中高频出现的客诉处理、职业打假、食品安全三大核心痛点，两位律师结合自身丰富的执业经验，用通俗易懂的语言拆解法律条款，用真实的案例剖析风险要点，让在场餐饮人“听得懂、记得住、用得上”。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 30px 0px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; width: 27%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; margin: 0px -27px 0px 0px; align-self: flex-end; z-index: 1; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; flex-flow: column; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"z-index: 1; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px -20px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; width: 20px; border-radius: