height: 1.2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;background-color: rgb(7, 0, 73);align-self: stretch;padding: 0px 20px 0px 10px;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;border-top-right-radius: 10px;border-bottom-right-radius: 10px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 3px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">常规客诉与职业打假</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;padding: 0px 10px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">党俏律师围绕「职业打假」展开专题讲解，她通过分享多起职业打假典型案例，为大家明确了常规客诉与职业打假的核心区别——常规客诉的核心是解决消费过程中出现的实际问题，而职业打假人的购买行为脱离生活需求，核心诉求是获取赔偿，甚至会以举报、诉讼为手段施压牟利，两者存在明显差异。党律师提醒大家重点关注商品原材料、配料标注、宣传用语等易被职业打假人紧盯的细节，从源头规避风险；让在座餐饮人更直观了解职业打假的套路与应对要点，避免重蹈覆辙。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 95%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KAOThu2SXBwia4py7Tm0TeiaiaRvWPtNNdcUApHhHEJc9555P4Xc9TUJ1vUIdZHLzUBxibrfzeHjHVCMkjJBTux0kYrdGjydxqPMIYVib1UZGApg/640?wx_fmt=png#imgIndex=4\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 611px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"7\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;border-top-left-radius: 20px;overflow: hidden;background-color: rgb(165, 49, 254);padding: 0px 10px;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 28px;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;background-color: rgb(7, 0, 73);align-self: stretch;padding: 0px 20px 0px 10px;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;border-top-right-radius: 10px;border-bottom-right-radius: 10px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 3px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">食品安全与客诉处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;padding: 0px 10px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">客诉处理关系到门店口碑与发展，而食品安全则是餐饮经营的生命线，重中之重。刘舒律师紧扣餐饮行业新出台的《餐饮服务连锁企业落实食品安全主体责任监督管理规定》（市场监管总局第104号文，以下简称“104号文”），系统总结了与餐饮食品安全密切相关的法律法规体系，明确了104号文施行以来，对餐饮连锁企业总部、门店、中央厨房的监管要求变化，让大家清晰掌握合规经营的法律依据。随后，刘律师结合真实案例，对餐饮门店新型客诉案例进行复盘，深入剖析案例中总部与门店的合规漏洞、客诉处理不当等问题。刘律师建议大家做到“日管控、周排查、月调度、年汇总”，重视食品安全问题，更要重视每一起客诉，合规处置化解矛盾。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 95%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBwFNz7APicEHBfqaPibuWMyvGnPH3lFrtZwalLGunKU64Qe37Z7w3Pv7sPkPicnVp9dDme2kATS5hGyoVTfU5UiaoNsluSTF8sAkXU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=5\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-siz